// Two selected experts exercise the noncompact route-ID stride, normalized
// weighted reduction, in-place residual update, K=768, and the output tile
// tail. Uniform 0xaa Q6_K bytes decode to a deterministic nonzero row with
// negative signed group scales.
check.case public @qwen3_moe_routed_down_q6k_q8_1_x4_nonzero_residual_case {
  %token_count = check.literal value(1) : index
  %input_size = check.literal value(768) : index
